# BioKIN EIT Board

Hardware design files for the BioKIN electrical impedance tomography readout board.

## Contents

- KiCad design files
- Gerber manufacturing files
- Bill of materials
- Schematics
- Assembly documentation

## Status

Research prototype. The design has not been qualified for clinical or commercial use.

